{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19290","headline":"和李六侍御文宣王庙释奠作 · 刘禹锡","name":"和李六侍御文宣王庙释奠作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"叹息鲁先师，生逢周室卑。\n有心律天道，无位救陵夷。\n历聘不能用，领徒空尔爲。\n儒风正礼乐，旅象入蓍龟。\n西狩非其应，中都安足施。\n世衰由我贱，泣下爲人悲。\n遗教光文德，兴王叶梦期。\n土田封後胤，冕服饰虚仪。\n钟鼓胶庠荐，牲牢郡邑祠。\n闻君喟然叹，偏在上丁时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19290.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19290","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}